# Leave empty in development: Vite proxies /api to the backend (see vite.config.ts).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# For a production build, set the API origin in .env.production instead of here --
# Vite loads that file only for `vite build`, so `npm run dev` keeps using the proxy
# and local work never touches live data.
#
# It can stay empty there too: the backend serves this panel itself, so relative URLs
# already resolve to the right host and keep working on a custom domain.
